  "text": "```verilog\nmodule apbslave #(\n\tparameter\tC_APB_ADDR_WIDTH = 12,\n\tparameter\tC_APB_DATA_WIDTH = 32,\n\tlocalparam\tAW = C_APB_ADDR_WIDTH,\n\tlocalparam\tDW = C_APB_DATA_WIDTH,\n\tlocalparam\tAPBLSB = $clog2(C_APB_DATA_WIDTH)-3\n) (\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPCLK, PRESETn,\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPSEL,\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPENABLE,\n\toutput\treg\t\t\tPREADY,\n\tinput\twire\t[AW-1:0]\tPADDR,\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPWRITE,\n\tinput\twire\t[DW-1:0]\tPWDATA,\n\tinput\twire\t[DW/8-1:0]\tPWSTRB,\n\tinput\twire\t[2:0]\t\tPPROT,\n\toutput\treg\t[DW-1:0]\tPRDATA,\n\toutput\twire\t\t\tPSLVERR\n);\n\n\treg\t[AW-1:0]\tADDR;\n\treg\t\t\tSTATE;\n\treg\t\t\tVALID;\n\treg\t\t\tREAD;\n\treg\t\t\t[DW-1:0]\tDATA;\n\treg\t\t\t[DW/8-1:0]\tWSTRB;\n\n\t// State Machine\n\t// IDLE: Waiting for PSEL and PENABLE\n\t// READ: Processing read transaction\n\t// WRITE: Processing write transaction\n\n\tinitial begin\n\t\tADDR = 0;\n\t\tSTATE = IDLE;\n\t\tVALID = 0;\n\t\tREAD = 0;\n\t\tDATA = 0;\n\t\tWSTRB = 0;\n\tend\n\n\talways @(posedge PCLK or negedge PRESETn) begin\n\t\tif (!PRESETn) begin\n\t\t\tADDR <= 0;\n\t\t\tSTATE <= IDLE;\n\t\t\tVALID <= 0;\n\t\t\tREAD <= 0;\n\t\t\tDATA <= 0;\n\t\t\tWSTRB <= 0;\n\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\tPRDATA <= 0;\n\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\tend\n\t\telse begin\n\t\t\t// State Logic\n\t\t\tcase (STATE)\n\t\t\t\tIDLE: begin\n\t\t\t\t\tif (!PSEL || !PENABLE) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\t\telse begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tADDR <= PADDR;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tREAD <= ~PWRITE;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDATA <= 0;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tWSTRB <= PWSTRB;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSTATE <= (READ) ? READ : WRITE;\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tend\n\n\t\t\t\tREAD: begin\n\t\t\t\t\t// Simulate read data generation (e.g., address mapping)\n\t\t\t\t\tDATA <= {AW{1'b0}} | PADDR; // Placeholder for actual logic\n\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\tPRDATA <= DATA;\n\t\t\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\t\tSTATE <= IDLE;\n\t\t\t\tend\n\n\t\t\t\tWRITE: begin\n\t\t\t\t\t// Simulate write data storage (e.g., register update)\n\t\t\t\t\tDATA <= PWDATA;\n\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\tPRDATA <= DATA;\n\t\t\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\t\tSTATE <= IDLE;\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tendcase\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// Output assignments\n\tPREADY <= (STATE == IDLE) ? 1'b1 : 1'b0;\n\tPRDATA <= DATA;\n\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0; // Always low for in-range accesses as per requirement\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>\n<|endoftext|>",
